{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "相對於美國－墨西哥、以色列－巴勒斯坦邊界興建阻止人民自由往來的「界牆」，下列\n哪些國家之間已撤除邊境管制，人民可以自由往來？", "options": {"A": "土耳其、法國、德國、義大利", "B": "冰島、丹麥、挪威、瑞典", "C": "瑞士、瑞典、愛爾蘭、保加利亞", "D": "匈牙利、羅馬尼亞、捷克、塞爾維亞"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 18.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 23.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 12.0, "B": 44.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 25.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 24.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 20.0, "p_value": 29.0, "p_high": 44.0, "p_low": 18.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [50.0, 33.0, 25.0, 21.0, 18.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "國內部分產業在國際市場上面臨區域的貿易整合危機，例如台灣石化業部分產品在\n2008 年已被中國課徵 6.5％的反傾銷稅，但隨著中國於 2010 年加入某區域組織生效後，\n該組織內成員國輸往中國的相關產品的關稅會降至 0。因台灣尚未加入該組織，使得台\n灣的石化、機械及汽車等產業在銷往該組織的成員國時，均會受到差異關稅的影響。\n請問這個區域結盟組織是：", "options": {"A": "歐盟", "B": "亞太經濟合作組織", "C": "東協加一", "D": "經濟合作與發展組織"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 75.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 95.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 24.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 47.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 91.0, 83.0, 69.0, 35.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某高中舉辦分組地理考察活動，各組同學進行實察的過程中，需要處理的工作項目包\n括：（甲）繪製地圖、統計圖表等展現資料；（乙）利用相機與 GPS 或地圖作紀錄；（丙）\n規畫實察路線；（丁）蒐集、整理考察地區的文獻和圖片。試問其工作項目的先後步驟\n為何？", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙丁", "B": "乙甲丁丙", "C": "丙丁甲乙", "D": "丁丙乙甲"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 81.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 92.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 68.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 81.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 68.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 89.0, 84.0, 76.0, 63.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
