{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-029", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 29, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "為因應勞工成本的上揚，某出口導向廠商計畫將沿海工廠的員工由26萬人降至10萬人，將\n生產基地轉向內陸地區，但此廠商的工廠區位轉移的計畫所面臨的最大問題應是？", "options": {"A": "資金", "B": "土地", "C": "勞動力", "D": "交通運輸\n- 4 -\n第 5 頁 98年指考\n共 7 頁 地理考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "27-29", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 80.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 93.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 62.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 80.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 62.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 90.0, 86.0, 78.0, 52.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-030", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 30, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "原住民由原鄉遷移至都市後，為什麼明知危險仍然選擇居住在三鶯橋下行水區的聚\n落？\n甲、社區的認同感 乙、居住空間較貼近大自然 丙、都市房價過高\n丁、較佳的社會福利 戊、交通較為便捷", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "丙丁戊", "C": "甲乙丁", "D": "乙丙戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "30-32", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 90.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 94.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 84.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 90.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 84.0, "discrimination": 10.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 93.0, 92.0, 90.0, 80.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-031", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 31, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "有關原住民遷至都市的現象，解釋正確的是：\n甲、原住民在原鄉謀生不易，屬於拉力 乙、大都市生活條件優良形成拉力\n丙、城市有較好工作機會形成推力 丁、子女在都市能有更好發展屬於拉力\n戊、文化與語言因素使原住民在都市謀生困難屬於中間障礙", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "甲丙丁", "C": "乙丁戊", "D": "乙丙戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "30-32", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 90.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 99.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 3.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 76.0, "D": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 1.0, "p_value": 90.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 76.0, "discrimination": 23.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 98.0, 96.0, 91.0, 68.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-032", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 32, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列是社區規畫師在部落進行調查時，所記錄的各方對部落拆除事件的議論，其中哪項\n是正確的？", "options": {"A": "當遇到河川地被佔用的問題時，可透過計畫變更方式重劃行水區來解決此問題", "B": "靠近行水區之農耕專用園區接近水源，可以種植水稻，有利維繫原住民傳統文化", "C": "即使這些原住民來自不同的原鄉，但共同的命運使得三鶯橋下的聚落成為一個社區", "D": "上述爭議包含河川治理與都市原住民生存權利，而這兩項議題的孰輕孰重宜用投\n票決定"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "30-32", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 10.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 65.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 84.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 17.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 65.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 76.0, 67.0, 57.0, 37.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-033", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 33, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在淡水河防洪規畫中，是以下列哪種方案來解決台北橋的\n洪流瓶頸問題？", "options": {"A": "此河段堤防加高以攔堵洪水", "B": "此河段上游側闢建分洪道，以疏導洪峰流量", "C": "台北橋引道加長，堤線後移、拓寬河道，以紓緩瓶\n頸", "D": "關渡、五股與社子北部限建，闢為洪水管制區以滯\n洪"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "33-34", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 10.0, "B": 52.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 13.0, "B": 60.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 43.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 14.0, "p_value": 52.0, "p_high": 60.0, "p_low": 43.0, "discrimination": 17.0, "p_quintiles": [62.0, 57.0, 54.0, 50.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-034", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 34, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "河道若能加以濬深，洪流瓶頸即可解決，但台北橋段位於\n盆地區，下列哪種作用會使河道的疏濬功能無從發揮？", "options": {"A": "襲奪", "B": "堆積", "C": "回春", "D": "侵蝕\n圖 5 1960年代淡水河下游流域圖\n- 5 -\n98年指考 第 6 頁\n地理考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "33-34", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 86.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 50.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 13.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 86.0, "p_low": 50.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 78.0, 68.0, 58.0, 45.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-035", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 35, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "國際分工的生產模式對生產鏈所連結的各國或地區帶來的影響是：", "options": {"A": "各國製造業的產值是以產品最終在何地組成來統計", "B": "各國製造業的產值是以產品的本地附加價值來統計", "C": "製造業者致力增加在生產鏈中所佔的產品重量比重", "D": "製造業者致力增加在生產鏈中所投入的勞動力比重"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "35-36", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 13.0, "B": 54.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 12.0, "B": 72.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 37.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 20.0, "p_value": 54.0, "p_high": 72.0, "p_low": 37.0, "discrimination": 35.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 63.0, 54.0, 45.0, 32.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-036", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 36, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "跨國生產鏈的組成會隨時間而變化，其連結的國家或地區並非固定不變。生產環節在\n地理上的變動主要是受下列哪種區位因子變化的影響：", "options": {"A": "區位擴散", "B": "區位聚集", "C": "比較利益", "D": "推拉因素"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "35-36", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 85.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 95.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 69.0, "D": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 4.0, "p_value": 85.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 69.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 94.0, 91.0, 85.0, 59.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-037", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 37, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在建築物頂樓加蓋違建物，對都市所可能帶來的不良影響包括：\n甲、景觀天際線的破壞 乙、違反容積率限制 丙、降低土地的價值\n丁、違反建蔽率限制 戊、增加對逃生、消防等公共設施的負擔", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "甲丙丁", "C": "甲乙戊", "D": "乙丁戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "37-38", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 65.0, "D": 29.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 90.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 3.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 35.0, "D": 54.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 65.0, "p_high": 90.0, "p_low": 35.0, "discrimination": 55.0, "p_quintiles": [93.0, 83.0, 70.0, 52.0, 27.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-038", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 38, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "舊社區的老舊公寓，較易出現加蓋違建，這種現象最能以下列哪種都市發展的概念來\n解釋？", "options": {"A": "都市擴張", "B": "社區營造", "C": "鄰避現象", "D": "土地使用分區"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "37-38", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 42.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 17.0, "D": 22.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 62.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 21.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 23.0, "B": 10.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 23.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 42.0, "p_high": 62.0, "p_low": 23.0, "discrimination": 39.0, "p_quintiles": [67.0, 52.0, 42.0, 31.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-039", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 39, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "社頭織襪業以「家庭即工廠」的家庭代工，來取代工廠的一貫化作業方式，具有哪些\n經營上的優勢？\n甲、降低廠房、機器等固定成本\n乙、可快速反應市場變化，更新產品設計\n丙、工資可壓低至接近中國的工資水平\n丁、使生產更具彈性，小量和量大的訂單均可承接\n戊、原料、半成品與產品間的運輸成本可以降低", "options": {"A": "甲乙丁", "B": "乙丙戊", "C": "丙丁戊", "D": "甲丁戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "39-40", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 43.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 47.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 58.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 38.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 30.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 53.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 43.0, "p_high": 58.0, "p_low": 30.0, "discrimination": 28.0, "p_quintiles": [62.0, 49.0, 41.0, 36.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-geography-040", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 40, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "台灣的織襪業在面臨國際激烈的競爭下，很多原設於高雄、苗栗、台北的織襪廠都將\n工廠遷移至社頭鄉或鄰近鄉鎮來繼續生產。請問這些廠商的區位轉移是因為下列哪種\n經濟效益所致？", "options": {"A": "地方經濟", "B": "聚集經濟", "C": "區域經濟", "D": "全球化經濟\n貳貳貳貳 、、、、 非非非非 選選選選 擇擇擇擇 題題題題 （（（（ 20 分分分分 ））））"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "39-40", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 81.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 94.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 63.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 3.0, "p_value": 81.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 63.0, "discrimination": 31.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 92.0, 87.0, 79.0, 53.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
